{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55718","headline":"送灵云和尚颂（题拟） · 师备","name":"送灵云和尚颂（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三十年来只如常，叶落几回（卷十九作「几回叶落」）放毫光。\n自（卷十九作「从」）此一去云霄外，圆音体性应法王。\n（见《祖堂集》卷十、卷十九。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"师备","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}